          <ns0:criteria operator="AND">
            <ns0:criterion test_ref="oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.ms.iis.8.5.server:tst:310" comment="(Verify unspecified objects are not assigned to ACL) Open Explorer and navigate to the inetpub directory. Right-click 'inetpub' and select 'Properties'. Click the 'Security' tab. Verify the permissions for the following users:  System: Full control Administrators: Full control TrustedInstaller: Full control ALL APPLICATION PACKAGES (built-in security group): Read and execute ALL RESTRICTED APPLICATION PACKAGES (built-in security group): Read and execute Users: Read and execute, list folder contents CREATOR OWNER: Full Control, Subfolders and files only  If the permissions are less restrictive than what is listed, this is a finding." />
            <ns0:criterion test_ref="oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.ms.iis.8.5.server:tst:311" comment="(File Perm assigned to Users group for inetpub directory) Open Explorer and navigate to the inetpub directory. Right-click 'inetpub' and select 'Properties'. Click the 'Security' tab. Verify the permissions for the following users:  System: Full control Administrators: Full control TrustedInstaller: Full control ALL APPLICATION PACKAGES (built-in security group): Read and execute ALL RESTRICTED APPLICATION PACKAGES (built-in security group): Read and execute Users: Read and execute, list folder contents CREATOR OWNER: Full Control, Subfolders and files only  If the permissions are less restrictive than what is listed, this is a finding." />
            <ns0:criterion test_ref="oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.ms.iis.8.5.server:tst:312" comment="(File Perm assigned to ALL APPLICATION PACKAGES for inetpub directory) Open Explorer and navigate to the inetpub directory. Right-click 'inetpub' and select 'Properties'. Click the 'Security' tab. Verify the permissions for the following users:  System: Full control Administrators: Full control TrustedInstaller: Full control ALL APPLICATION PACKAGES (built-in security group): Read and execute ALL RESTRICTED APPLICATION PACKAGES (built-in security group): Read and execute Users: Read and execute, list folder contents CREATOR OWNER: Full Control, Subfolders and files only  If the permissions are less restrictive than what is listed, this is a finding." />
          </ns0:criteria>
        </ns0:definition>
